></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>A mountain made of rock and ice. It is located in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrsung\">Tyrsung</a>. Giants inhabitate this place. This place is a good location for mid level players (40 to 60) to hunt. Without bonus you can easily make 40k/h exp, and with bonus, 65k/h. If you have capacity to carry all the Frost Giant Pelt, you can make a good profit, every one can be sold for 160gps, and hunting for two hours you can get about 20 to 25 Frost Giant Pelts.\n</p><p>It is the home of the <a href=\"#/quest/skeleton-decoration-quest\">Skeleton Decoration Quest</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jotunar 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"196\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jotunar_1_218ad4.png\" width=\"202\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jotunar -1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jotunar_1_26e32f.png\" width=\"198\"/></span><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jotunar-2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"214\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jotunar_2_2e5d69.png\" width=\"212\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Monsters on Jotunar</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Giant\